# Text files are stored with LF. Shell scripts and the texts a package ships (licences and guides) are also checked out
# with LF, so a publish carries the same bytes from every fresh checkout. An older checkout keeps its CRLF copies until they are
# rewritten (tools/tests/test_repository_files.py checks the working tree and gives the command).
* text=auto
*.sh text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
LICENSE text eol=lf
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.rgba binary
